        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat-item">
          <div class="hero-stat-item__number" data-count="4.9">0</div>
          <div class="hero-stat-item__label">Google Rating</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ LOCAL CONTEXT ══ -->
<section class="cam-why">
  <div class="cam-why__container">

    <div class="cam-why__image-wrap">
      <img
        src="/images/window-film-camden-nj-urban-heat.jpg"
        alt="Delaware River and Ben Franklin Bridge connecting Camden NJ and Philadelphia - South Jersey's summer heat and humidity make window film essential" title="Delaware River and Ben Franklin Bridge connecting Camden NJ and Philadelphia - South Jersey's summer heat and humidity make window film essential"
        class="cam-why__image"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="cam-why__stat-card">
        <div class="cam-why__stat-item">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          <span>88-94°F summer highs</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cam-why__stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="cam-why__stat-item">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          <span>72-74% summer humidity</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cam-why__content">
      <div class="cam-why__eyebrow">South Jersey Climate & Context</div>
      <h2 class="line-mask cam-why__headline" data-stagger="140" aria-label="Why Camden Needs Window Film">
        <span class="line-mask__line" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-mask__inner" style="--i:0">Why Camden</span></span>
        <span class="line-mask__line" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-mask__inner" style="--i:1">Needs Window Film</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="cam-why__intro">Three conditions unique to Camden make window film less of an upgrade and more of a practical necessity. Summer heat regularly pushes past 88°F with 72-74% humidity. The <a href="https://dep.nj.gov/wp-content/uploads/dsr/urban-heat-island-camden-rps-2004.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#7CB342">NJ Department of Environmental Protection formally identified Camden as an urban heat island</a> - dense brick and asphalt amplifying temperatures well beyond surrounding suburbs. And with one of New Jersey's highest crime rates, security film is one of our most-requested installs here.</p>
      <ul class="cam-why__bullets">
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Summer highs of 88-94°F with 72-74% humidity make south- and west-facing glass uncomfortable and costly without solar control film
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Camden's urban heat island effect - documented by the NJ DEP - means buildings absorb and retain more heat than surrounding communities
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
Camden's crime rate of 45 per 1,000 residents makes security and anti-smash film one of the highest-ROI installs we do in the area
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cam-why__climate-facts">
        <div class="cam-why__climate-item">
          <span class="cam-why__climate-num">88°F</span>
          <span class="cam-why__climate-label"><a href="https://www.weather-us.com/en/new-jersey-usa/camden-climate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#7CB342">Avg summer high in Camden</a></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cam-why__climate-item">
          <span class="cam-why__climate-num">45/1K</span>
          <span class="cam-why__climate-label">Crime rate per 1,000 residents (FBI)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cam-why__climate-item">
          <span class="cam-why__climate-num">72-74%</span>
          <span class="cam-why__climate-label">Relative humidity in peak summer months</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cam-why__closing">Since 2008, Window Film Philadelphia has installed window film in Camden for homeowners, commercial tenants, and property managers throughout South Jersey — <a href="/benefits/energy-savings/" style="color:#7CB342">solar control</a>, <a href="/benefits/safety-and-security/" style="color:#7CB342">security</a>, <a href="/benefits/privacy-window-film-philadelphia/" style="color:#7CB342">privacy</a>, and <a href="/benefits/decorative-promotional/" style="color:#7CB342">decorative film</a> installed by certified technicians with a lifetime warranty on every job.</p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="cam-why__cta">
        Get a free Camden assessment
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12h15m0 0l-6.75-6.75M19.5 12l-6.75 6.75"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TRUSTED EXPERTS ══ -->
<section class="cam-expert">
  <div class="cam-expert__container">
    <div class="cam-expert__content">
      <p class="cam-expert__eyebrow">CAMDEN'S TRUSTED EXPERTS</p>
      <h2 class="cam-expert__title">Why choose us for window film in Camden?</h2>
      <p class="cam-expert__body">At Window Film Philadelphia, we've been installing window film in Camden, NJ and surrounding South Jersey communities since 2008. Whether you're looking to reduce the summer heat in your home, improve energy efficiency in your office, protect your storefront from graffiti, or add decorative privacy film to a conference room — our certified installers deliver flawless results on every window film installation in Camden.</p>
      <p class="cam-expert__body">Camden's urban environment comes with unique challenges: high crime rates, intense summer humidity, and commercial properties that need maximum protection. Our window film for Camden addresses every one of these concerns — security reinforcement, heat rejection, and UV blocking in a single professional install. Every window film contractor in Camden should carry full insurance and manufacturer certifications; ours do. We also serve <a href="/cities/philadelphia/" style="color:#7CB342">Philadelphia</a>, <a href="/cities/reading/" style="color:#7CB342">Reading</a>, and communities throughout the greater metro area.</p>
      <div class="cam-expert__stats">
        <div class="cam-expert__stat">
          <span class="cam-expert__stat-num">2008</span>
          <span class="cam-expert__stat-label">Serving South Jersey since</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cam-expert__stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="cam-expert__stat">
          <span class="cam-expert__stat-num">500+</span>
          <span class="cam-expert__stat-label">Camden area installs completed</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cam-expert__image-col">
      <img
        src="/images/window-film-camden-expert-interior.jpg"
        alt="Warm South Jersey residential interior with large windows — window film keeps this Camden home comfortable year-round" title="Warm South Jersey residential interior with large windows — window film keeps this Camden home comfortable year-round"
        class="cam-expert__img"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ RESIDENTIAL + COMMERCIAL SLIDER ══ -->
<section class="cam-prop-slider" id="camSlider">
  <div class="cam-prop-slider__track" id="camTrack">

    <!-- SLIDE 01: Commercial -->
    <div class="cam-prop-slider__slide" data-slide="0">
      <img src="/images/window-film-camden-nj-commercial.jpg" alt="Modern commercial office in Camden NJ with floor-to-ceiling windows - window film for South Jersey commercial properties" title="Modern commercial office in Camden NJ with floor-to-ceiling windows - window film for South Jersey commercial properties" class="cam-prop-slider__bg" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="cam-prop-slider__overlay"></div>
      <div class="cam-prop-slider__content">
        <div class="cam-prop-slider__step">01</div>
        <h2 class="cam-prop-slider__title">Commercial Window Film
in Camden, NJ</h2>
        <p class="cam-prop-slider__desc">From Ferry Avenue storefronts to Cooper University Health Care facilities to waterfront office buildings - we install window film across the full range of Camden commercial properties. Solar control, security, anti-graffiti, and decorative film all available.</p>
        <ul class="cam-prop-slider__benefits">
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            Solar control film cuts cooling costs 25-35% in South Jersey commercial buildings
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            Security film protects storefronts from smash-and-grab and holds glass on impact
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
