        <div class="cam-nh"><span class="cam-nh__name">Collingswood</span><span class="cam-nh__desc">Arts-district borough along the PATCO Hi-Speedline corridor. Older row homes benefit from solar and privacy window film to cut heat gain and street-level visibility.</span></div>
        <div class="cam-nh"><span class="cam-nh__name">Pennsauken</span><span class="cam-nh__desc">Commercial and industrial township on the Delaware River. Anti-graffiti and solar control window film are the most common requests from Pennsauken warehouses and retailers.</span></div>
